{"id": "3324815", "name": "אורך קשת של גרף פונקציה", "defaultgrade": 1, "penalty": 0.1, "options": {"multiplicationsign": "dot", "complexno": "i", "matrixparens": "[", "inversetrig": "cos-1", "logicsymbol": "lang", "sqrtsign": true}, "nhints": 0, "questiontext": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\"><div style=\"background:#F4F1F5;border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px\"><div style=\"font-weight:bold;color:#4b1f6f;margin-bottom:6px\">הנתונים</div><p>נתונה הפונקציה:</p><p>\\[ y = {{CT:0}} \\]</p><p>חשבו את אורך הקשת של גרף הפונקציה בקטע \\( [1,{{CT:1}}] \\).</p></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:14px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><div style=\"font-weight:bold;color:#4b1f6f;margin-bottom:8px\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;width:26px;height:26px;line-height:26px;text-align:center;border-radius:50%;background:#4b1f6f;color:#fff;margin-left:8px\">א׳</span>הנגזרת</div><div style=\"background:#FAF9FB;border-radius:8px;padding:10px;direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate\">\\( y' = \\) [[input:ans1]]</div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate;margin-top:6px\">[[validation:ans1]]</div></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:14px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><div style=\"font-weight:bold;color:#4b1f6f;margin-bottom:8px\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;width:26px;height:26px;line-height:26px;text-align:center;border-radius:50%;background:#4b1f6f;color:#fff;margin-left:8px\">ב׳</span>אורך הקשת</div><div style=\"background:#FAF9FB;border-radius:8px;padding:10px;direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate\">\\( L = \\) [[input:ans3]]</div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate;margin-top:6px\">[[validation:ans3]]</div></div></div>", "generalfeedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\"><div style=\"background:#F4F1F5;border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:12px 16px;margin-bottom:12px\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">מבנה הפתרון:</b> נוסחת אורך הקשת היא \\( L=\\int\\sqrt{1+(y')^2}\\,dx \\). תרגילים מסוג זה נבנים כך שהביטוי תחת השורש יוצא ריבוע מושלם.</div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">שלב 1 — הנגזרת</b><br><p>\\[ y' = {{CT:2}} \\]</p></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">שלב 2 — הביטוי תחת השורש</b><br>בהעלאה בריבוע, המחובר האמצעי הוא \\( -1/2 \\), ויחד עם ה-1 מתקבל \\( +1/2 \\) — בדיוק ריבוע של סכום:<p>\\[ 1+(y')^2 = \\left( {{CT:3}} \\right)^2 \\;\\Longrightarrow\\; \\sqrt{1+(y')^2} = {{CT:3}} \\]</p></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">שלב 3 — אינטגרציה</b><br><p>\\[ L = \\int_1^{ {{CT:1}} } \\left( {{CT:3}} \\right) dx = {{CT:4}} \\]</p></div></div>", "specificfeedback": "[[feedback:prt1]]", "prtcorrect": "Correct answer, well done.", "prtpartiallycorrect": "Your answer is partially correct.", "prtincorrect": "Incorrect answer.", "inputs": [{"name": "ans1", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 18, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}, {"name": "ans3", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 16, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}], "prts": [{"name": "prt1", "value": 1, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans1", "tans": "Dy", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0.4, "nextnode": 2, "answernote": "A-ok", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\"><b>סעיף א׳ — נכון.</b></div>"}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": 2, "answernote": "A-no", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\"><b>סעיף א׳ — שגוי.</b> גזרו כל מחובר בנפרד: \\((x^3)'=3x^2\\) ו-\\(\\left(\\frac{1}{x}\\right)'=-\\frac{1}{x^2}\\).</div>"}}, {"name": 2, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans3", "tans": "Len", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "+", "score": 0.6, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "C-ok", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\"><b>סעיף ב׳ — נכון.</b></div>"}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "+", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "C-no", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\"><b>סעיף ב׳ — שגוי.</b> אינטגרלו את \\(\\sqrt{1+(y')^2}\\) על פני הקטע והציבו את הגבולות.</div>"}}]}], "qvnames": ["A", "Bd", "Dy", "Fexpr", "Len", "Rad"], "nvariants": 12}